    rdf:value """Tuesday, June 9, 1908
I Tatti. 
Cool. Fine.
Massage 7.30-8.15.
Unpacked, etc. Went to town and called on Maud Cruttwell and bought some of her furniture, and called on Mascha von Heiroth who is in the Maternità with her ten days old baby named Algar!
Rembielinski was here when I came back, sitting under the trees talking with Bernhard. 
Dr. Giglioli came. Called also on Houghtons. Felt something queer in the air. Cecil and Alice are there. """^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 183 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1908> .

